  "command": "./ai/bin/ai task validate-code MEMORIES-0005 --tier full (shared local-dev Postgres/Redis/MinIO); npm run test:e2e (backend, against the same stack); review-cycle-17 fix pass: implemented Google OIDC ID-token verification with nonce binding (GoogleOAuthClient now requests/verifies a signed id_token — signature via Google's published JWKS using Node's built-in crypto, issuer, audience, expiry, and a nonce bound 1:1 with state in the same cookie) closing the previously-unimplemented state/nonce security requirement; OAuthController.callback now allowlists only access_denied as user cancellation, mapping every other provider error to a stable provider_error reason instead of misreporting it as cancellation; OAuthRedirectHandler now only acts on the literal success/error statuses (an unrecognized oauth= value is ignored instead of being treated as an implicit success) and maps provider_error to a distinct safe message",
